<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Credit year net up 3.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Credit year net up 3.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		213.82	vs	206.07</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	62.2	 vs	 59.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,488.50	vs    1,086.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  440.82	vs	384.75</p>
<p>    Minorities	less   83.82	vs less  73.17</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries loss    0.95	vs gain 103.37</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)     15.0	 vs	 15.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Hong Leong Credit Bhd. It is involved in banking and other financial activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
